  "description": "The e-commerce management system should be able to meet the following requirements:\nUser login and registration function: Users can log in to the system with their username and password, and register new accounts.\nProduct management function: Administrators can add, modify, and delete product information, and set attributes such as price and inventory of products.\nOrder management function: Users can browse and select purchased products, and generate orders. Administrators can view and manage the status of orders, such as confirming payment, shipping, cancellation, and other operations.\nMarketing activity function: Administrators can create and manage promotional activities, such as discounts and promotions, to attract users to purchase products.\nPayment and logistics functions: Users can choose appropriate payment methods and query the logistics information of orders."
